concept:crimes-hostages-act-1989-article-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 States Parties shall co-operate in the prevention of the offences set forth in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-4 ;
    values:originalText "article 1, particularly by: (a) taking all practicable measures to prevent preparations in their respective territories for the commission of those offences within or outside their territories, including measures to prohibit in their territories illegal activities of persons, groups and organizations that encourage, instigate, organize or engage in the perpetration of acts of taking of hostages; (b) exchanging information and co-ordinating the taking of administrative and other measures as appropriate to prevent the commission of those offences." ;
    skos:definition "article 1, particularly by: (a) taking all practicable measures to prevent preparations in their respective territories for the commission of those offences within or outside their territories, including measures to prohibit in their territories illegal activities of persons, groups and organizations that encourage, instigate, organize or engage in the perpetration of acts of taking of hostages; (b) exchanging information and co-ordinating the taking of administrative and other measures as appropriate to prevent the commission of those offences."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "300be10f6bd13e3b26ad0df6fb4fef1653f3fa22d9c88e21b66b0e10f4a124e7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Cooperation in preventing offenses" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
